@10 = ~Lady Lydia~
@11 = ~Lydia's Pearl Necklace~
@12 = ~A string of fine pearls set on a delicate silver chain. It belonged to Lady Lydia's late husband and carries considerable sentimental value.~
@20 = ~Lady Lydia's Necklace~
@21 = ~Lady Lydia, a resident of Candlekeep, has lost a pearl necklace somewhere in the gardens. She asked me to find it for her.~
@22 = ~I found Lady Lydia's pearl necklace and returned it to her. She rewarded me with 10 gold pieces and I gained a little respect for helping her.~
