@56 = ~Astarion has hired us to kill an art dealer named Derek in Baldur's Gate. We are to bring Derek's body back to Astarion for a payment of 6000 gold.~
@57 = ~Derek escaped Baldur's Gate before we could reach him. Astarion claimed that his fate was already sealed, then attacked us.~
@58 = ~We decided not to continue working for Astarion. He turned hostile and attacked us.~

